<h3><u>Bhai Shabbir ka haider ka pisar</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Abbas hai Abbas, Abbas hai Abbas, Abbas hai Abbas, hai hai abbas) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Bhai shabbir ka, Haider ka piser aata hai)</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Jang karne bani hasham) x2 ka kamar aata hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">bhai shabbir.</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Aysa tanha ko bahadur koi dekha na suna (Abbas hai Abbas) x3</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Aysa tanha ko bahadur (koi dekha na suna) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Zaat me apni jo, lashkar sa nazar aata hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jang karne.</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Yaad aati hai sakina ki bari kalb ke sath (Abbas hai abbas) x3</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Yaad aati hai sakina ki (bari kalb ke sath) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Name abbas ka hoto pe agar aata hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jang karne.</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Khoon bhara aaya alam ro ke ye zainab ne kahaa (Abbas hai abbas) x3</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Khoon bhara aaya alam ro ke (ye zainab ne kahaa) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Bhayi tum aye nahi moo ko jigar aata hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jang karne.</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Door se apka alam dekh ke bachi boli (Abbas hai abbas) x3</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Door se apka alam dekh (ke bachi boli) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Dekho darya ke chacha lot ke gar ataa hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jang karne..</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Sharm se rukta nahi neze pe abbas ka sar (abbas hai abbas) x3</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Sharm se rukta nahi neze pe (abbas ka sar)x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Beridaa kumba jo gazi ko nazar aata hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jang karne..</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Hote zainab ke madad ake karo ai bhai (abbas hai abbas)x3</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Hote zainab ke madad ake (karo ai bhai) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Awo abbas ke zinddan ka gar aata hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jang karne.</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Nawha parta hai hasan kat ke kurbal rehaan (abbas hai abbas)x3</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Nawha parta hai hasan kat ke (kurbal rehaan)x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Hai duwa gazi ki kisko ye hunar aata hai</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Jang karne..</span></font></div></p>
                 